<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ M-3 money supply fell 1.4 pct in January.</title>
<headline>NZ M-3 money supply fell 1.4 pct in January.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of New Zealand on Thursday released the following estimated money supply figures for January.</p>
<p>    M3		     Jan 1997</p>
<p>Dec 1996 Jan 1996</p>
<p>    mthly change	 -1.4 pct     1.0 pct	  -1.5 pct</p>
<p>    yr-on-yr change    11.9 pct     11.8 pct	 12.9 pct</p>
<p>    PSC		    Jan 1997     Dec 1996	 Jan 1996</p>
<p>    mthly change	  2.2 pct	2.1 pct	  0.5 pct</p>
<p>    yr-on-yr change    13.1 pct     11.3 pct	 13.7 pct</p>
<p>    M1		     Jan 1997     Dec 1996	 Jan 1996</p>
<p>    mthly change	  2.6 pct	0.0 pct	 -2.1 pct</p>
<p>    yr-on-yr change     1.5 pct     -3.2 pct	 -0.1 pct</p>
<p>-- Welington Newsroom 64 4 4714 273</p>
</text>
